            "review_title": "Review at David Pizzeria",
            "review_text": "Lisa P\nSydney, Australia52 contributions\n0\nTakeaway disappointment.\nMay 2026 • Couples\nI have been here before on our visits not so long ago here in Vung Tau, really loved it but my second experience here not so good. \nMy husband was not feeling well so we decided to get takeaway. Ordered the Porcini Tagliatelle and a Spaghetti Bolognese. Both came in a round bowl which was fine but the food was very bland with no sauce. We both got a small piece of bread each which was nice but the meal left us feeling very underwhelmed. \nHubby's spaghetti was like the size of a kids meal, no flavour, didn't even fill half of the container, mine not much better. I was expecting so much flavour with mine as it was advertised as an imported sauce but it was disappointing to say the least as it was almost double the price of the spag Bol. Sorry David's you didn't hit the mark this time.\nRead more\nWritten May 8, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
