            "review_title": "Review at David Pizzeria",
            "review_text": "Philip U\n4 contributions\n1\nNot the best experience we've had.....\nFeb 2026 • Couples\nWent to the restaurant Tuesday (24th Feb) evening. Plenty of spaces, went upstairs as it was our last night in Vun Tau. \nSo it took 10 minutes to find someone upstairs, ordered (lasagna and fries, risotto and garlic bread) - asked for it all come together as a meal. Fries and garlic bread came \" your other bits will be in a bit\", ok replied. 15 minutes later, the lasagna and risotto came...... fries cold, drank all the drink etc. Service was terrible, they had problems understanding English and Vn (we speak a little). Food was average tbf, had better at the other Italian. Drinks - Saigon Green was 45k for a can (very expensive). Other couple had the wrong meals sent and had to swap ½ their meal - so finished before the others came etc. May just be a bad night for them.\nOver all, a rubbish last dinner in the town.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten February 25, 2026",
