            "review_text": "Kha N\n2 contributions\n0\nTerible service dismissive attitude toward customers\nJan 2026 • Family\nMy family and I visited David Pizza today. We were dressed quite casually, and we received almost no service. When a staff member brought food to a nearby table, I asked to place our order; they acknowledged me, but then no one ever came back. My wife eventually had to go to the counter herself just to get someone to take our order. I strongly believe the restaurant needs to address this dismissive attitude toward customers! I will be uploading a few photos before I leave\nInsider tip:\nTerrible service at David Pizza\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 10, 2026",
