            "review_text": "michael t\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam31 contributions\n1\nMenu lovely but the kitchen cannot supply.\nJan 2026 • Couples\nWorst thing. When you know a restaurants menu, you turn up and order a dish and they say sorry we don’t have today. This is an Italian restaurant with no ravioli. It’s all over the menu just not in the kitchen. Just drank the wine. Will go to Bistro 9 for my food after girlfriend finishes her meal.\nInsider tip:\nCheck they have the food on the menu before you go. It’s an Italian, they have no ravioli. It’s all over the menu. Just not in the kitchen.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 8, 2026",
